    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "wait but my grandma always says putting butter on a burn helps it heal faster and protects it. it feels so much better when i even just touch it with something greasy. are you sure i shouldn't just use some kind of heavy ointment or even coconut oil so it doesn't dry out/get infected? i really dont want to go to the doctor if i can help it.",
